message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "ESP32-simple_cycle_counter: an LED duty-cycle counter"
abstract: "An ESP32 program that drives the on-board LED (GPIO 2) through rising and then falling duty cycles in software, counting the cycles. Written in C with ESP-IDF and FreeRTOS, in VS Code with PlatformIO, at the Universidade de Brasília with Prof. Jones Yudi Mori Alves da Silva."
